Package: pretestTAP
Type: Package
Title: Test-and-Pool (TAP) Integrative Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Gaochenyin", family = "Gao", email = "781747089@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions to simulate data and perform the TAP estimator for integrating probability and non-probability samples. The code reproduces the results from the paper "Pretest estimation in combining probability and non-probability samples".
